me_at_review": 247873, "last_played": 1739244939}, "language": "english", "review": "I use to play this game religiously for years.  I just recently stated playing again after a couple years gone.  I got punished for leaving a a game that was a stomp.  They put me in a low priority que.  I waited over 1 HOUR, and still no games.  That is not how you treat costumers you wanna keep.  No game should have wait times of even 10-15 min, let alone over an hour.  I will deleteing for good.  Good-bye!", "timestamp_created": 1718144304, "timestamp_updated": 1718144304, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "166756492": {"recommendationid": "166756492", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977773980", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 125524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2816, "playtime_at_review": 105256, "last_played": 1744990630}, "language": "english", "review": "I hate this game as much as it hates me", "timestamp_created": 1717618578, "timestamp_updated": 1717618578, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "166629490": {"recommendationid": "166629490", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992388083", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 366846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1328, "playtime_at_review": 309288, "last_played": 1745039888}, "language": "english", "review": "Toxic game full of nec*beards. Do not play this.\r\n10/10 would spend 5k hours on toxic game again", "timestamp_created": 1717459945, "timestamp_updated": 1717459945, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "166547816": {"recommendationid": "166547816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058461523", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 683558, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 672170, "last_played": 1740175235}, "language": "english", "review": "A lot of terrible people play this game.  The game itself is awesome and when you find good people to play with there is very few better experiences,", "timestamp_created": 1717352946, "timestamp_updated": 1717352946, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 32, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.696763992309570312", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "166070441": {"recommendationid": "166070441", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988749662", "num_games_owned": 253, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 136955, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 93, "playtime_at_review": 113522, "last_played": 1743982580}, "language": "english", "review": "Ja n\u00e3o bastasse esse desequilibrio entre os herois, ainda fizeram esse novo sistema de escolher skill, dota ficou um lixo, desinstalei e n\u00e3o volto a jogar mais", "timestamp_created": 1716686717, "timestamp_updated": 1716686717, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490566045045852661", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165999960": {"recommendationid": "165999960", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011612795", "num_games_owned": 243, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 215704, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 195605, "last_played": 1736797007}, "language": "english", "review": "I've been playing Dota 2 for 12 years now, off and on throughout my life it is one of the few constants. In high school, my friends and I spent many nights playing when there was only one courier. In college I played once or twice a year on my rented laptop from school. During the pandemic It was a way for my brothers and I to connect when we couldn't actually visit each other. It holds a great place in my life.\n\n[h3]The Good[/h3]\n- Gameplay is dynamic, engaging and rewarding once you get the hang of it. There are so many moving parts that when you make your first big play, there is very little that can match the feeling of satisfaction when played just right. \n- Flourishing Pro Scene: If you want to get better there are countless new and old pro players that stream or release content on Youtube to help you improve, and often times Discord chats to find players to play with.\n- Semi Consistent Updates: They just released one of the biggest updates the game has seen since Talents were released in 2016, or neutral items were released in 2019, or when they DOUBLED the size of the map in 2022. Valve isn't afraid to experiment with this game, and while you can get stuck on a single patch for a long time, you can always know that Valve Devs are working on something truly different to add.\n\n[h3]Negatives[/h3]\n- Mental Health: This is a team game. I love it for that, but playing with others can be frustrating and demoralizing. You can also find yourself \"chain queuing\" which after multiple losses can really effect your mood outside the game. My girlfriend and I have a rule that I cant start a game after 10pm because if i lose badly sometimes I will be too angry to fall asleep or talk before bed. You have to find these ways to look inward yourself, and without barriers it can really negatively impact you.\n- The Community: I said it a bit above, but if you're new to online games there is so much racism, sexism, anger etc. I've met really great people playing dota, but the brain tends to remember the bad eggs. Remember there is a mute button.\n- Communication from Valve: There can be crickets from valve sometimes. They ARE working on stuff, but if you read reddit to much you can get a bit riled for no reason.\n\nOverall, best game I've ever played by a long margin.", "timestamp_created": 1716594963, "timestamp_updated": 1716595474, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165999199": {"recommendationid": "165999199", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070902474", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 78858, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 133, "playtime_at_review": 63447, "last_played": 1745034615}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun game if you've got friends and play around at lower ranks trying stuff out. However, this game has one of the most toxic fanbases in existence, second only to maybe LoL. If you intend on playing solo, do your sanity a favor and just avoid this game like the plague. You will be flamed, griefed, have slurs screamed at you, etc. if these players perceive even a microsecond of sub-optimal play.", "timestamp_created": 1716593662, "timestamp_updated": 1716593662, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508196711540222168", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165986683": {"recommendationid": "165986683", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088951015", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 251544, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1309, "playtime_at_review": 196583, "last_played": 1745081079}, "language": "english", "review": "yes.", "timestamp_created": 1716577732, "timestamp_updated": 1716577732, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505108535289764404", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165981164": {"recommendationid": "165981164", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078490054", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1051637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1021760, "last_played": 1743177844}, "language": "english", "review": "i love this game, only issue i have with it is every update i have to either run a scan to fix things or reinstall which is the only quite annoying thing.", "timestamp_created": 1716571560, "timestamp_updated": 1716571560, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165940570": {"recommendationid": "165940570", "author": {"steamid": "76561197963303712", "num_games_owned": 514, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 125519, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 511, "playtime_at_review": 108321, "last_played": 1744588791}, "language": "english", "review": "yea its pretty good", "timestamp_created": 1716509516, "timestamp_updated": 1716509516, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165874043": {"recommendationid": "165874043", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976225678", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 81031, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 160, "playtime_at_review": 73539, "last_played": 1744737665}, "language": "english", "review": "I have played this game for 1,200+ hours.  I have a group of friends who only plays this game (they suck at all other games, which I am good at), so I am stuck playing it with them.  If you never played before, I would say stay away from this game.  It will suck the life out of your soul.  First of all even if you play exactly right, if your team is bad you will lose.  Games take around 40 minutes so its a huge time commitment.  Finally it is by far the most toxic community I have ever experienced in a video game.", "timestamp_created": 1716409178, "timestamp_updated": 1716409178, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.539923965930938721", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165685674": {"recommendationid": "165685674", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072033727", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 155641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 131699, "last_played": 1734809146}, "language": "english", "review": "broken matchmaking system", "timestamp_created": 1716138357, "timestamp_updated": 1716138357, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165661112": {"recommendationid": "165661112", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987504437", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 89649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86403, "last_played": 1729796693}, "language": "english", "review": "get good, then its fun... sometimes", "timestamp_created": 1716111876, "timestamp_updated": 1716111876, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "165430038": {"recommendationid": "165430038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026378302", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 469323, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 465045, "deck_playtime_at_review": 59, "last_played": 1739471955}, "language": "english", "review": "I really can't recommend this game any more. Match making is imbalanced now in every mode but all pick ranked, and the meta is so stale that if you do not group up as five you will lose the game. Toxicity has gotten to the worst point that I've seen in 10 years of Dota. It's sad how bad the US community for this game has gotten and how much Valve has abandoned this game.", "timestamp_created": 1715805550, "timestamp_updated": 1715805550, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "163986720": {"recommendationid": "163986720", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069243078", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 73923, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 65489, "last_played": 1728261248}, "language": "english", "review": "always on the brink of uninstalling, but always down for another game", "timestamp_created": 1714569375, "timestamp_updated": 1714569375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "163713586": {"recommendationid": "163713586", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043355760", "num_games_owned": 215, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 65484, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 26712, "deck_playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1743880260}, "language": "english", "review": "Ah, Dota 2, the game where toxicity flows like a never-ending river and the community is as welcoming as a pack of hungry wolves. Strap in, folks, because this rollercoaster of emotional distress is about to make you question your life choices.\n\nLet's start with the community, shall we? A lovely bunch, really, if your idea of lovely involves getting flamed for daring to pick a hero someone else wanted. And don't even get me started on the joy of encountering smurfs who stomp around like they own the place, leaving a trail of shattered dreams in their wake.\n\nBut wait, there's more! Ever wanted to experience the thrill of spending an hour in a match, only to have your hopes dashed by a single misstep? Congratulations, Dota 2 has got you covered. And let's not forget the joy of watching your teammates rage quit faster than you can say \"GG.\"\n\nAnd don't even think about trying to improve. Sure, you could watch tutorials, read guides, and practice till your fingers bleed, but why bother when you can just blame your losses on everyone else? It's the Dota 2 way!\n\nBut overall, despite the salt mines and the occasional dumpster fire of a match, I would still recommend this game. Because beneath all the toxicity lies a surprisingly addictive experience that somehow keeps you coming back for more punishment. So, if you're ready to dive headfirst into a cesspool of salt, frustration, and occasional glimpses of actual gameplay, welcome to Dota 2. Just remember to bring a hazmat suit and a healthy dose of sarcasm. You're gonna need it.", "timestamp_created": 1714238422, "timestamp_updated": 1714238422, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "163521584": {"recommendationid": "163521584", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001017957", "num_games_owned": 399, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 163, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 163, "last_played": 1372708823}, "language": "english", "review": "Came with the Valve Complete Pack when it wasn't free... \n\nEven these 2.7 hours were a complete waste of time. \nIt would have been a better value to buy Steam trading cards for the whole money.", "timestamp_created": 1713989935, "timestamp_updated": 1713989935, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.430656790733337402", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "163411344": {"recommendationid": "163411344", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079079664", "num_games_owned": 750, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 17621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17549, "last_played": 1730521361}, "language": "english", "review": "fun with friends in customs or against bots but the community is way too toxic. you'd have more fun drinking poison than being screamed at by these addicts. cool game toxic community and no real way to circumvent that other than to go do literally anything else", "timestamp_created": 1713830427, "timestamp_updated": 1713830427, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541655302047729492", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}, "163361802": {"recommendationid": "163361802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069403751", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 264020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 264018, "last_played": 1726018216}, "language": "english", "review": "demonic battlegrounds very fun", "timestamp_created": 1713760628, "timestamp_updated": 1713760628, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false}}, "query_summary": {"num_reviews": 100, "review_score": 8, "review_score_desc": "Very Positive", "total_positive": 5419, "total_negative": 672, "total_reviews": 6091}, "cursors": {"AoJ46rLm9YADf4zzuQM=": "Sat Apr 19 11:46:10 2025", "AoJ4usb4losDc8qotQQ=": "Sat Apr 19 12:03:45 2025"}}
